  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.83,
      314.13,
      455.86,
      352.46
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 88 of the Civil Procedure Code (Chapter 101)and the legal effect of the section as amended is to provide for an appeal to the ProvincialHigh Court with leave obtained first in case of an order setting aside or refusing to set asidethe judgment entered upon default.",
